 ct registration deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: AAAI/ACM Conference on AI\, Ethics\, and Soci
 ety\nWebsite: https://www.aies-conference.com/2026/\nSource URL: https://
 www.aies-conference.com/2026/call-for-papers/\nLocation: Malmo\, Sweden\n
 Topics: Ethics & Governance\, Fairness & Responsible AI\, Explainability 
 & Interpretability\, Robustness & Safety\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper
 -based / interdisciplinary\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 202
 6-08-20\nNotes: Official AIES 2026 pages list Malmo\, Oct 12-14\, 2026 co
 nference dates and abstract/paper submission deadlines.\nScope: Ethics an
 d societal consequences of AI\, connecting computer science\, law and pol
 icy\, social science\, and philosophy. Defining concerns include governan
 ce and power\, accountability after deployment\, value alignment\, fairne
 ss\, human-AI interaction\, and institutional practice. Technical work is
  relevant through a serious ethical or societal contribution.\nAdditional
  topics: Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\, Privacy-preserving ML\nScope
  sources (2026): https://www.aies-conference.com/2026/call-for-papers/\nS
 cope last checked: 2026-10-07
